{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"(The word \"marshmallow\" comes from the mallow plant species (Althaea officinalis), a herb native to parts of Europe, North Africa, and Asia which grows in marshes and other damp areas. The plant's stem and leaves are fleshy and its white flower has five petals. It is not known exactly when marshmallows were invented, but their history goes back as early as 2000 BCE. Ancient Egyptians were said to be the first to make and use the root of the plant to soothe coughs and sore throats, and to heal wounds. The first marshmallows were prepared by boiling pieces of root pulp with honey until thick. Once thickened, the mixture was strained, cooled, and then used as intended.)","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:27:10.592000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878948408222711808","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"(today I learned)\n\"I suppose so. Are we meant to prepare in some specific way?\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:27:51.754000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878948580868648991","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"No it will be short and simple.... though I guess youll be the first to be marries as part of my faith.....\" he pauses \"Sabrine... there is one more thing for you to teach those that need answers about me....\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:29:44.115000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878949052144816188","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'What's that?' she puts down the marker-in-progress, paying full attention.","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:30:08.688000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878949155211464704","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Endure.... Something the wardens said made me realize.... one of my strengths is the will to continue on.... to shoulder whatever weight set on me.... even my death\" he says while motioning to the scar on his neck \"was me walking to to something... I put off years longer than any Chinn ever had.... so long it would have killed me to not... but even then... I went in fully determined to win... I have seen people broken, shackled... and I looked for a way to break their chains.... I lived in the ocean.... where the water is heavy beyond imagining...\" he pauses, realizing his words are flitting around \"I was supposed to die when the final stone was set.... it was my determination that kept me around so that you all could say good bye.... So remind people they are not weak.... we can endure more hardship than we think.... more pain.... we are always under the weight of life... but we cannot let that weight crush us.... and when you feel you cant carry yourself any longer\" he motions to Ed \"Know that others will help carry you through those times... as ed helped me walk today when i was at my weakest.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:37:37.607000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878951038114209844","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I suppose I made a good wish today.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:38:46.514000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878951327131111484","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"(are you calling me out :v)\nshe nods. 'Understood.'","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:38:49.275000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878951338711597116","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Endurance, determination, drive to succeed... whatever people would like to call it.'","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:42:08.175000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878952172958679061","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'I hope I can encourage people to ask for help if needed, whether from me or others. It's tough, I know, but being able to ask for help is its own form of determination, don't you think? Like, 'I'm struggling, but I don't want to give up. Please give me a weapon to help fight my battle.''","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:43:56.791000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878952628527169546","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"This is precisely what I am talking about.... thank you for understanding\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:45:19.179000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878952974087520266","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"There were shooting stars while we were having the chat with the Wardens, and Columbia suggested we make a wish. I wished for the same strength for everyone working for others, as I saw you have for your duty, and that I got from others when deciding to not give up and ask to be brought back to life.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:45:52.283000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878953112935747615","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"A good wish... I likely would have been more greedy with mine\" he says, in a way that lets you know he is at least somewhat joking","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:46:53.608000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878953370151432203","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Right now I don't really feel like I need to wish for anything. And beyond that, a lot is up to the living to put in the needed work. Besides, what benefits everyone, benefits me too.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:50:25.248000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878954257833938964","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"You could have asked for the tastiest sandwich ever created.... a long fruitful life.... to have just one more day with a lost loved one.... all three are things I would seriously consider asking for.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:52:18.886000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878954734466252810","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she nods. 'I wished for harmony, and Kukudh... well, was Kukudh, but they wished for everyone having access to good food. Which is sort of important for life, I'm pretty sure.'","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:52:26.128000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878954764841398272","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she gets up and goes to hug Gil.","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:52:56.096000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878954890536304661","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Gil stands and opens his arms","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:53:10.187000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878954949638238238","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'I... can't say I didn't consider that last one myself...'","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:53:36.322000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878955059256377354","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Tastiest sandwich sounds like a great goal to search for. Long fruitful life sounds like something you make for yourself. And the last one, well, I so far I've been lucky to not need to consider it.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:54:24.212000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878955260121595914","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Than you are a wise man Roy... wise and fortunate\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:54:53.297000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-22T10:55:01.044000Z","id":"878955382112944139","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"a few tears fall onto Gil. 'Katrine... for a moment, I wanted to be able to talk to her. And apologise. But... the best apology now will be living my life, and helping people in her honour, I think.'","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:55:48.697000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878955614477377596","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Swarm mentality, I suppose. We're used to putting in the work for the swarm, and the swarm puts in work for us in return. What we make together is what we get. Can't always win against fate, but at least we always have our own work to fall back on.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:56:10.017000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878955703899947008","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"he kisses Sabrine on the forehead as a father would \"then you have been listening to this old man\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:56:47.859000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878955862620798987","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Speaking of our own work... Does you becoming a new Warden change our mission?\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:57:24.003000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878956014219714601","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"(it'll most likely be an epilogue thing with no clear result)\n'I'm still considering looking into my birth family, there's geneaology records at the library, but for now I'd only be sending letters. And even if they reject me - which I would understand - or I don't find them, I have my family here.'","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:57:44.156000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878956098747502653","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Gil nods to Sabrine then addresses Roy \"It creates a further need..... For me to stay strong.... I need followers or I will perish\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T10:59:02.254000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878956426314285087","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'So as I thought, we should stay here, at least for a while.'","created_at":"2021-08-22T11:00:25.196000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878956774198235136","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'And then even if we do leave, just temporarily. I'm alright with that.'","created_at":"2021-08-22T11:00:43.730000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878956851935469609","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Yeah. Irynx invited us to go west with her and look for more followers. But at the same time, we have the city to look after. I don't know where a new mender would be more needed, here, or further west.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T11:01:03.098000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878956933170728980","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'And I mean, if I send Kukudh with her, I can be in both places at once. Sort of.'","created_at":"2021-08-22T11:01:28.073000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878957037923500103","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Sabrine... I told you this is to be my first..... you will have to set up more places for people to feel my presence... and Roy.... this city should be fixed.... but there will be more mending needed out there.... Take some time to learn what you can... but see the world.... Head west... take friends.... My story would have been a boring one had I never left the Twin Vents\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T11:03:01.073000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-22T11:04:18.461000Z","id":"878957427993759774","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she nods. 'So, once the city's more stable, and you have enough followers here to survive us taking a journey... I wonder if we can set up teleportation circles somehow.'","created_at":"2021-08-22T11:04:21.183000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878957763999445033","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
