{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"(excellent)","created_at":"2021-08-22T11:04:41.692000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878957850020438046","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I see. Then I think we'll stay here for a bit, to help with making the city stable. And once that's done... I think this mechanic has some catching up on living in the nature to do.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T11:05:27.970000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878958044124422165","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I don't want this place to be your grave.... So don't stay here and make it so\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T11:05:30.825000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878958056099151912","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'It'll be... a change *living* in nature as opposed to just *undying* in nature.'","created_at":"2021-08-22T11:06:12.756000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878958231970516992","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
